Exercise 1: Create Your First Method
Task

Create a method that prints:

Plain Text
Welcome to Groovy
Solution
Groovy
def welcome() {
println "Welcome to Groovy"
}
 
Output
Plain Text
Welcome to Groovy
Exercise 2: Method with Parameter
Task

Pass your name to a method.

Solution
Groovy
def greet(name) {
println "Hello ${name}"
}
 
greet("Hyarel")
Output
Plain Text
Hello Hyarel
Exercise 3: Method Returning Value
Task

Add two numbers and return result.

Solution
Groovy
def add(a, b) {
return a + b
}
 
def result = add(10, 20)
 
println result
Output
Plain Text
30
