Exercise 7: Switch Case
Task

Check environment.

Solution
Groovy
def env = "DEV"
 
switch(env) {
 
case "DEV":
println "Development"
break
 
case "QA":
println "Testing"
break
 
case "PROD":
println "Production"
break
 
default:
println "Unknown"
}
Output
Plain Text
Development
