Exercise 10: Multiplication Table
Solution
Groovy
def num = 5
 
for(i in 1..10) {
println "${num} x ${i} = ${num*i}"
}
Output
Plain Text
5 x 1 = 5
5 x 2 = 10
...
5 x 10 = 50
