Real Jenkins Pipeline Relation

Everything you learn in Level 2 is used in Jenkins:

Groovy
def appName = "nginx"
 
def deploy(app) {
println "Deploying ${app}"
}
 
deploy(appName)

This is exactly the Groovy syntax used inside Jenkins Pipelines. After Level 2, you'll be ready for Level 3: File Handling, Closures, Exception Handling, and Jenkins Pipeline Basics. 🚀
